<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Dcl Itachi - App Website</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f6f8;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 80px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    h1 {
      color: #1877f2;
    }
    p {
      color: #333;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    footer {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #777;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Welcome to Dcl Itachi App</h1>
    <p>
      This website is created for testing and development of our Facebook Developer App.
      We respect user privacy and do not misuse any personal data.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you have any questions, please contact us at:<br>
      <strong>karkirupesh852@gmail.com</strong>
    </p>
    <footer>
      © 2026 Dcl Itachi. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
